            "name": "Missing Final Quoted Field",
            "line": '127.0.0.1 - - [21/May/2026:10:00:00 +0000] "GET / HTTP/1.1" 200 123 "-" "-"',
            "expected": None
        },
        {
            "name": "Escaped Quotes in Request",
